[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    76[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C7 | `driver` | `x` at each decimal-width boundary of `j = 2*i`: `5, 6, 50, 51, 500, 501, 5000, 5001, 50000, 50001` (i.e. `i` where `j` gains a digit) | `cfg_c7_j_width_boundaries` | [x] |
