[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    88[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    89[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Feature combinations
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    90[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    91[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `translation/Cargo.toml` declares **no `[features]` section**, so the crate has
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    92[0m:[38;5;10m[49m exactly one configuration: the default. `cargo metadata` confirms the feature
